cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its derived annotations, please cite it as below."
title: "ntx: provenance-first surveillance and hypothesis triage for neuropeptide and neurotrophic claims"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, offline-capable system that detects neuropeptide,
  neurotrophic and neurotropic mentions in the biomedical literature,
  normalizes them to identifiers, extracts directional claims with exact
  provenance, appraises study design, and mines testable evidence gaps.
